$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General Procedure for the Synthesis of 7 To a stirred mixture of
Pd(PPh3)4 (0.005 mmol), Na2CO3 (0.1 mmol), 4a (0.1 mmol), phenylboronic
acid (0.13 mmol) under N2 atomosphere was added the solvent of DMF/ H2O
(4 mL, 2:1) via syringe at room temperature. The reaction mixture was
stirred for about 12 hours at 90 oC. After cooled, the mixture was washed
with H2O, extracted with AcOEt, dried over Na2SO4, then filtered and
concentrated. The residue was purified by column chromatography over
silica gel with hexane/ AcOEt as the eluent. 7.
2-methyl-2',3'-diphenyl-2H-spiro[benzo[d]isothiazole-3,1'-indene]
1,1-dioxide (7a) Yield: 97%; white solid. M.p. 224-225 °C; 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.89 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1H), 7.53-7.28 (m, 10H), 7.19 (td, J
= 7.4, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 7.13 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H), 7.09-7.00 (m, 3H), 6.93
(dd, J = 8.2, 1.4 Hz, 2H), 2.60 (s, 3H) ppm; 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ
145.0, 143.8, 143.2, 141.3, 137.9, 135.2, 134.2, 133.5, 133.1, 129.8,
129.51, 129.49, 129.1, 129.0, 128.6, 128.3, 128.1, 127.6, 124.1, 123.5,
122.0, 121.7, 78.7, 24.3 ppm; IR (film): 3058, 2929, 1598, 1467, 1298,
1204, 1167, 1128, 1060 cm-1; HRMS (EI) m/z calcd for C28H21NO2S:
435.1293; found: 435.1299.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Lewis Acid Catalyzed Cascade Reaction of
