$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 9-(4-n-Butylphenyl)-10-(4-chlorophenyl)phenanthrene.
9-Iodo-10-(4-n-butylphenyl)phenanthrene (1.6 g, 3.7 mmol), 4-chlorophenyl
boronic acid (730 mg, 4.9 mmol), Na2CO3 (8.3 g, 78 mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (200
mg, 0.37 mmol), THF (60 mL) and water (40 mL) were added to a 200 mL
three-necked flask with a reflux condenser, and the the mixture was
refluxed under an atmosphere of nitrogen for 23 h. The resulting mixture
was then partitioned between Et2O and water. The organic layer was washed
with saturated aqueous solution of NH4Cl and water, dried (MgSO4) and
concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by column chromatography
on silica gel (hexane). A title compound as a white powder (1.5 g, 97%).
Rf; 0.45 (hexane). Mp: 156°C. 1H NMR (CDCl3, 399.78 MHz): 8.82-8.79 (m,
2H), 7.67-7.65 (m, 2H), 7.61-7.59 (m, 1H), 7.53-7.47 (m, 3H), 7.22-7.20
(m, 2H), 7.09-7.00 (m, 6H), 2.60 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 2H), 1.62-1.54 (m, 2H),
1.33-1.28 (m, 2H), 0.94 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (CDCl3, 150.84 MHz):
141.3, 138.4, 137.8, 136.5, 136.1, 132.6, 132.5, 132.1, 131.8, 130.9,
130.2, 130.1, 128.1, 127.95, 127.94, 127.6, 126.82, 126.80, 126.7, 126.6,
122.7, 122.6, 35.4, 33.5, 22.4, 14.2. IR (ATR):3061 w, 3024 w, 2953 w,
2926 w, 2851 w, 1487 m, 1445 w, 1416 w, 1091 m, 1043 w, 1016 m, 859 m,
834 m, 800 m, 777 w, 761 s, 726 s, 708 w. HRMS (EI+): Calcd for C30H25Cl
420.1645, Found 420.1644.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki-Miyaura cross-coupling reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Nickel-Catalyzed Alkynylation of Anisoles via C-O Bond Cleavage
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Tobisu, Mamoru; Takahira, Tsuyoshi; Ohtsuki, Akimichi; Chatani, Naoto
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2015), 17(3), 680-683

